/graft/

# Logs
logs/
# `logs/` above is for runtime logs. Any `logs` segment under the Next app tree
# is a route, not output — this used to name one exact hub path and silently
# dropped the file the moment that route moved.
!frontend/src/app/**/logs/

# AI agent tooling
